1	line	Anne	Well, let's not waste any more time! Stranger, are you ready for your interview?
1	select	Start the Pandemonium quest?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	I guess so...?
2	line	Will	Let's get you started with a nice easy question: What is your name?
2	line	Player	{player}.
2	line	Anne	Pleased to meet you, {player}. I'm Anne, and this is Will.
2	line	Will	Next question: Do you have any experience captaining a ship?
2	line	Player	Not really...
2	line	Will	Oh...
2	line	Anne	Will, it's important we not be too picky! It's a competitive market, after all.
2	line	Will	Okay, final question: Do you agree to waive all rights to pursue legal action against your new employer in the event of injury or horrific death?
2	line	Player	Is that likely to happen?
2	line	Anne	Not at all!
2	line	Player	I'm not sure if I...
2	line	Will	Excellent! Well then, {player}, I'm pleased to say that we have the results of your interview. You bring some impressive stuff to the table. We'd love to offer you the role!
2	line	Anne	Congratulations!
2	line	Player	Thanks... only, you didn't actually mention what the role was...
2	line	Will	Ah, how forgetful of us! Given that you've already accepted, how about we discuss the details on our ship.
2	line	Player	But I didn't accept anything...
2	line	Anne	Just let us know when you're ready, and we'll hop aboard!
2	select	Select an option
2	option	I guess I'm ready...
3	line	Player	I guess I'm ready...
