0	section	At the boat
0	section	Talking to Anne or Will
1	line	Will	Lovely! The open sea!
1	line	Player	It's not really that open... We haven't even left port yet.
1	line	Anne	Well, good news, {player}, because that's where you come in! You're our new helm!
1	line	Player	Helm?
1	line	Will	It means you're in charge of the ship's helm! In other words, you're responsible for steering the ship!
1	line	Player	It's more of a boat really...
1	line	Anne	Well, we all have to start somewhere!
1	line	Player	Right... So if I'm manning the helm, what will you two be doing?
1	line	Will	Well, it's simple, isn't it? We're in charge!
1	line	Player	Have you ever actually done this before?
1	line	Anne	Many times!
1	line	Will	Just never on our own ship before! This is an exciting first day for... well, we haven't actually named our business yet, but I'm sure we'll come up with a good name soon.
1	line	Player	And what does this business do?
1	line	Anne	We salvage shipwrecks of course!
1	line	Player	Of course. Alright then, I don't remember doing it, but apparently I committed to this. Where is our first wreck?
1	line	Will	We've got a good one to get us started! Last time we were on the Pandemonium, we purchased a map that should lead us to an old pirate wreck.
1	line	Player	The Pandemonium?
1	line	Anne	Have you never been? It's a great place for a drink! We'll have to take you there!
1	line	Will	But first, let's collect some salvage! According to the map, the wreck is just east of the Karamja Shipyard, so south of here.
1	line	Anne	Over to you, {player}! Take the helm when ready.
1	action	end
