0	section	At the Pandemonium
0	section	Talking to 'Squawking' Steve Beanie
1	line	'Squawking' Steve Beanie	Yo ho ho and a Jolly Roger to you, me hearty! I can see from the fact that you're totally drenched from head to toe that you are a fellow scallywag sailor! The name's Steve Beanie! Pleased to meet you.
1	line	Player	I think I must be having some sort of fever dream... or maybe I'm dead?
1	line	'Squawking' Steve Beanie	Ha! Far from it, matey! Though the fever dream I can't comment on. They're rather common around here... but I assure you that it's well-nigh certainly like enough most likely not the rum doing it!
1	line	Player	Okay... You said words there, but I don't think they actually formed a sentence.
1	line	'Squawking' Steve Beanie	Ah, me wee hearty! You seem to be having quite the crisis! Thankfully, you've rigged the starboard and docked yourself at the right port! Welcome to the Pandemonium!
1	line	Player	Pandemonium?
1	line	'Squawking' Steve Beanie	Aye! To be sure! This here is the finest establishment in all the seas. Sit back! Have a drink! Let the good times, and the rum, flow!
1	line	Player	If this is the Pandemonium, do you know of a pair of salvagers called Will and Anne?
1	line	'Squawking' Steve Beanie	Avast ye! You name a pair of pinching looting plundering seadogs!
1	line	Player	I see. So you do know them. They claimed to have purchased a map here, but I'm guessing they weren't being totally honest about that...
1	line	'Squawking' Steve Beanie	Purchased?! Purchased?! You're pulling my leg, you scallywag! Those scurvy dogs came here and broke the one rule of the Pandemonium! That map was pilfered! Stolen!
1	line	Player	Well, I had quite the fun run in with them myself. They had me help them salvage an old shipwreck before throwing me overboard.
1	line	'Squawking' Steve Beanie	Arrr, you poor scallywag.
1	line	Player	Thank you. It was the map they stole that led them to the wreck. What do you know about it?
1	line	'Squawking' Steve Beanie	Not a lot, I'm afraid. You should hoist your sails and go speak to Ribs instead. It was his map they looted. He's the old dog over in the corner. Avast!
1	action	end
