1	line	Anne	Ah, look what we have here, Will! This looks like someone who needs a good job!
1	line	Player	What?
1	line	Will	Goodness, Anne, I think you're right! This one's clearly never worked an honest day in their life, and it's about time someone changed that!
1	line	Player	But I don't need a...
1	line	Anne	Alas! We are sadly not currently in a place where we can take on any more staff, but let us hope that changes soon!
1	line	Player	Okay...
1	box	The Sailing skill will release on the 19th November.
1	action	end
